{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55282","headline":"题处士林亭 · 李涛","name":"题处士林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝里高人宅，苍苔遶径深。\n卷帘山入户，摘菓鸟移林。\n石沼养龟水，月台留客琴。\n生涯一樽酒，名利不关心。\n（同前第五册第三一二三页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}